From: hzy <hzyitc@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: amlogic: add meson8b-onecloud device tree

Add device tree source for Thunder OneCloud (Amlogic S805 / meson8b).
The DTS itself is shipped via target/linux/amlogic/files/; this patch
only registers it in the amlogic DTS Makefile so the kernel build
produces meson8b-onecloud.dtb.

--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/amlogic/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/amlogic/Makefile
@@ -6,4 +6,5 @@ dtb-$(CONFIG_MACH_MESON8) += \
 	meson8b-ec100.dtb \
 	meson8b-mxq.dtb \
 	meson8b-odroidc1.dtb \
+	meson8b-onecloud.dtb \
 	meson8m2-mxiii-plus.dtb
